            "name": "DTF",
            "description": "Best for bold, colourful logos or graphics on any fabric.",
            "details": "<p>Direct to Film. Your artwork is printed onto a special film, coated with adhesive powder, then heat-pressed onto the garment. The design sits as a thin layer on top of the fabric.</p><p>Because it does not rely on the ink soaking into cotton, it prints the same bright colours on polyester, blends, nylon and dark garments — and it holds fine lines and solid blocks of colour well.</p>",
            "best_for": "Bold logos, bright colours, dark or synthetic fabrics, small runs"
